大丈夫と言わせてはくれないか
Won't you let me say "I'll be fine"?

306
00:25:17,325 --> 00:25:23,215
後から君のせいにしてはくれないか 今更意味ないから
Won't you let me blame you later? Because it's meaningless now.

307
00:25:23,435 --> 00:25:29,485
後から君のせいにしてはくれないか 出来ない約束を
Won't you let me blame you later for promises I couldn't keep?

308
00:25:29,485 --> 00:25:33,935
とうとう溢れる 一言一言ばかりに 脳を奪われるくらい
Overflowing at last, word by word, enough to steal my mind.

309
00:25:33,935 --> 00:25:37,365
意味を成さない 何も出来ない
Making no sense, unable to do anything.

310
00:25:37,365 --> 00:25:40,895
見えない 逃げたい 飛びたい 辞めたい
Can't see, want to run, want to fly, want to quit.

311
00:25:40,895 --> 00:25:44,915
さらさら いいから 沈め 沈め
Oh well, whatever, sink, sink!

312
00:25:44,915 --> 00:25:50,985
這い上がれないほどまで 飽きるまで 落とせ 落とせ
Until I can't climb back up, until I'm bored, drop me down!

313
00:25:50,985 --> 00:25:55,135
救い垂らす時まで
Until salvation is cast down.

314
00:25:55,135 --> 00:25:59,665
嘘臭い粒々を 喉から搾り出した悲鳴ごと噛み砕く
Chewing up fake granules along with screams squeezed from my throat.

315
00:25:59,665 --> 00:26:03,695
笑顔が苦手なばっかで 知ったような口ぶりに沿ってやり過ごす
Just because I'm bad at smiling, I get by following familiar tones.

316
00:26:03,695 --> 00:26:09,695
今日役立つ 眠たい眠たい 理想で救われることを待つ
Waiting to be saved by sleepy, sleepy ideals useful today.

317
00:26:09,695 --> 00:26:13,135
一番目は「い」の口で言う
The first is said with an "ee" mouth shape.

318
00:26:13,135 --> 00:26:16,635
力強く 固く 痛く 噛み締め
Strongly, firmly, painfully biting down.

319
00:26:16,635 --> 00:26:20,635
死んでしまえ しまえ
Just die already!

320
00:26:20,635 --> 00:26:23,635
この先も過去も知らず
Knowing neither future nor past.

321
00:26:23,635 --> 00:26:26,835
嫌いなら 壊せ 壊せ
If you hate it, break it, break it!

322
00:26:26,835 --> 00:26:30,385
どうせなら加害者になればいい
Might as well become the perpetrator.

323
00:26:30,385 --> 00:26:34,135
食べきれない棘立ちも 何も生まれない悲しみも
Unfinishable thorns, sorrows that breed nothing,

324
00:26:34,135 --> 00:26:37,135
味気なくて吐き出す前に
before spitting them out tastelessly,

325
00:26:37,135 --> 00:26:40,135
もう もう 次を歌え
sing the next song already!

326
00:26:40,135 --> 00:26:43,635
沈め 沈め 落とせ 落とせ
Sink, sink, drop, drop!

327
00:26:43,635 --> 00:26:47,335
踊り踊れ 灰色になり切る前に
Dance, dance, before turning entirely to ash.

328
00:26:47,335 --> 00:26:50,985
打ち鳴らせ 変われ 変われ
Ring out, change, change!

329
00:26:50,985 --> 00:26:55,685
眠り落ちる時まで 奪え 奪え
Until falling asleep, take, take!

330
00:26:55,685 --> 00:27:00,135
飼い慣らした嘘暴いて 煮え滾る頭に過ぎ去った虚像を見ていた
Exposing tamed lies, seeing past phantoms in my boiling head.

331
00:27:33,263 --> 00:27:36,663
嘘臭い粒々を 喉から搾り出した悲鳴ごと噛み砕く
Chewing up fake granules along with screams squeezed from my throat.

332
00:27:36,663 --> 00:27:40,163
笑顔が苦手なばっかで 知ったような口ぶりに沿ってやり過ごす
Just because I'm bad at smiling, I get by following familiar tones.

333
00:27:40,163 --> 00:27:46,163
今日役立つ 眠たい眠たい 理想で救われることを待つ
Waiting to be saved by sleepy, sleepy ideals useful today.

334
00:27:46,163 --> 00:27:49,663
一番目は「い」の口で言う
The first is said with an "ee" mouth shape.

335
00:27:49,663 --> 00:27:53,163
力強く 固く 痛く 噛み締め
Strongly, firmly, painfully biting down.

336
00:27:53,163 --> 00:27:56,163
死んでしまえ しまえ
Just die already!

337
00:27:56,163 --> 00:28:00,163
この先も過去も知らず 嫌いなら 壊せ 壊せ
Knowing neither future nor past; if you hate it, break it!

338
00:28:00,163 --> 00:28:03,663
どうせならがしゃになればいい
Might as well become outcasts.

339
00:28:03,663 --> 00:28:07,163
ため息れない 苛立ちも 何も生まれない悲しみも
Irritation I can't even sigh out, and sorrows born from nothing,

340
00:28:07,163 --> 00:28:11,663
味気なくて吐き出す前に もう もう 次を歌え
before spitting them out tastelessly, sing the next song already!

341
00:28:11,663 --> 00:28:16,163
沈め 沈め 落とせ 落とせ 踊り踊れ
Sink, sink, drop, drop, dance, dance,

342
00:28:16,163 --> 00:28:21,163
灰色になり切る前に 打ち鳴らせ 変われ 変われ 眠り落ちる時まで
before turning entirely to ash. Ring out, change, change, until falling asleep!

343
00:28:58,213 --> 00:29:02,313
アディショナルメモリー 作詞・作曲: じん
[Title: Additional Memory / Music & Lyrics: Jin]

344
00:29:25,613 --> 00:29:30,113
浮かんで 転げ落ちて 出会ったエンドロール
Floating up, tumbling down, meeting the end roll.

345
00:29:30,113 --> 00:29:36,613
歪んだ 変わり果てた 未来の走馬灯 もうおしまいね
A distorted, utterly changed lantern of the future's memories. It's already over.

346
00:29:36,613 --> 00:29:44,613
幕の切れてしまった 白昼夢は ただただ 虚しさを誤魔化して見せた
The daydream whose curtain has fallen just tried to mask the emptiness.

347
00:29:44,613 --> 00:29:49,613
思い出してしまう 夕焼ける空
I end up remembering the sunset sky,

348
00:29:49,613 --> 00:29:55,613
滲むメロディ 「帰ろう、道を間違えないように」
the blurring melody. "Let's go home, so we don't take the wrong road."

349
00:29:55,613 --> 00:30:03,113
懦弱になって ぎゅっと繋いだ手を 宙に向けて
Growing cowardly, holding the tightly clasped hands up toward the sky...

350
00:30:04,810 --> 00:30:08,090
贅沢な走馬灯
A lavish revolving lantern...

351
00:30:08,670 --> 00:30:11,250
夕凪の向こうに
Beyond the evening calm,

352
00:30:11,250 --> 00:30:13,250
恋を認めたためて火を灯す
I confess my love and light a flame.

353
00:30:13,870 --> 00:30:15,890
過ぎ去っていく
Fading away,

354
00:30:15,890 --> 00:30:18,050
腐っていく溶かした本音は
rotting away, my melted true feelings—

355
00:30:18,530 --> 00:30:23,050
存在証明を跨いでしまったひとり
I was all alone, stepping over my proof of existence.

356
00:30:23,630 --> 00:30:25,750
「あたし」なんてさ
"I" shouldn't have...

357
00:30:25,750 --> 00:30:27,890
「言いたくなかったな」
I didn't want to say that.

358
00:30:28,130 --> 00:30:32,230
拭えない涙も言葉も嘘嘘
Tears I couldn't wipe, and words, were all lies.

359
00:30:32,890 --> 00:30:37,590
友達なんかになりたくなかったな
I never wanted to become just friends.

360
00:30:37,910 --> 00:30:40,230
きっと届かないよな
It surely won't reach you, huh?

361
00:30:40,230 --> 00:30:42,030
ごめんね 大好きだよ
I'm sorry. I love you.

362
00:31:01,791 --> 00:31:03,971
これが勘違いなら
If this is a misunderstanding,

363
00:31:03,971 --> 00:31:06,271
知りたくなかったな
I didn't want to know.

364
00:31:06,271 --> 00:31:11,051
溢れ出る涙とか 空に吸い込まれる
Overflowing tears and such are sucked into the sky.

365
00:31:11,271 --> 00:31:13,251
もう戻れないのに
Even though I can't go back,

366
00:31:13,251 --> 00:31:15,531
もう感じないのに
even though I can't feel it anymore,

367
00:31:15,531 --> 00:31:18,071
今さらずくんだよ
it aches so much now.

368
00:31:18,071 --> 00:31:20,071
逆様になったまま
Remaining upside down.

369
00:31:32,311 --> 00:31:35,871
散っていった走馬灯
A scattering revolving lantern...

370
00:31:36,471 --> 00:31:39,131
夕凪の向こう
Beyond the evening calm,

371
00:31:39,131 --> 00:31:41,171
想いを染めた紅の詩
a crimson poem dyeing my thoughts.

372
00:31:41,631 --> 00:31:46,011
削れないでいて覚えていて残した本音は
Don't wear away, remember the true feelings left behind—

373
00:31:46,471 --> 00:31:50,871
幸せを跨いでしまったひとり
I was all alone, stepping over happiness.

374
00:31:51,511 --> 00:31:55,671
友達なんかで終わりたくなかったな
I didn't want it to end as just friends.

375
00:31:55,991 --> 00:32:00,111
届かない涙が空に吸い込まれる
Unreachable tears are sucked into the sky.

376
00:32:00,411 --> 00:32:02,871
これが勘違いでも
Even if this is a misunderstanding,

377
00:32:02,871 --> 00:32:05,511
これが勘違いでも
even if this is a misunderstanding,

378
00:32:05,511 --> 00:32:07,631
ずっと言いたかったの
I always wanted to say it.

379
00:32:07,631 --> 00:32:09,651
さよなら 大好きだよ
Goodbye. I love you.

380
00:33:13,973 --> 00:33:17,393
逃げ出した夜の往来 行方は未だ不明
Fled onto the night's traffic, destination still unknown.

381
00:33:18,373 --> 00:33:21,793
回り回って虚しくって 困っちゃったワンワンワン
Going in circles and feeling empty, what a dilemma, woof woof woof!

382
00:33:22,733 --> 00:33:26,513
失ったつもりもないが 何か足りない気分
I don't feel like I lost anything, but something's missing.

383
00:33:27,013 --> 00:33:31,933
ちょっと変にハイになって 吹き込んだ四輪車
Getting strangely high, blowing into a four-wheeler.

384
00:33:32,853 --> 00:33:34,773
兄弟よ如何かしよう
Oh brother, what should we do?

385
00:33:34,773 --> 00:33:37,033
もう何も考えない様
Let's not think about anything anymore.

386
00:33:37,533 --> 00:33:39,993
銀河系の外へと
Beyond the galaxy,

387
00:33:39,993 --> 00:33:41,893
さようなら
farewell!

388
00:33:41,893 --> 00:33:46,813
真実も 道徳も 動作しない イカれた夜でも
Even on a crazy night where neither truth nor morals work,

389
00:33:47,233 --> 00:33:51,553
僕ら手を叩いて笑い合う 誰にも知られないまま
we clap our hands and laugh together, known to no one.

390
00:33:53,173 --> 00:33:57,833
たった一瞬の このきらめきを
This sparkle of a single moment—

391
00:33:59,653 --> 00:34:03,413
食べ尽くそう二人でくたばるまで
let's devour it together until we drop,

392
00:34:03,413 --> 00:34:06,133
そして幸運を 僕らに祈りを
and offer a prayer of good fortune for us!

393
00:34:08,093 --> 00:34:10,273
まだ行こう
Let's go further,

394
00:34:10,273 --> 00:34:16,513
誰も追い付けないくらいのスピードで 稲妻の様に生きていたいだけ
living like lightning at a speed no one can catch up to.

395
00:34:21,033 --> 00:34:23,633
お前はどうしたい?
What do you want to do?

396
00:34:23,633 --> 00:34:26,013
返事はいらない
No reply is needed.

397
00:34:34,553 --> 00:34:38,213
転がした車窓と情景 動機は未だ不明
Rolling window scenery, motive still unknown.

398
00:34:39,193 --> 00:34:43,253
邪魔臭くて芳しくなくて 迷い込んだニャンニャンニャン
Troublesome and unfavorable, strayed in, meow meow meow!

399
00:34:44,573 --> 00:34:48,473
ここいらで落とした財布 誰か見ませんでした?
Has anyone seen the wallet I dropped around here?

400
00:34:49,113 --> 00:34:53,673
馬鹿みたいについてないね 茶化してくハイウェイ・スター
We're ridiculously unlucky, teasing highway stars.

401
00:34:54,193 --> 00:34:58,473
おう相棒 もう一丁 漫画みたいな喧嘩しようぜ
Hey partner, let's have another manga-like fight!

402
00:34:58,813 --> 00:35:03,973
洒脱になんないくらいのやつをお試しで
Let's try out something so unrefined it's funny.

403
00:35:05,911 --> 00:35:08,371
逃げ出したい夜の往来 行方はいまだ不明
The traffic of the night I want to run away from, my destination is still unknown

404
00:35:08,621 --> 00:35:12,581
回り回って虚しくって 困っちゃったワンワンワン
Wandering around and feeling empty, I'm in trouble, bow-wow-wow

405
00:35:12,581 --> 00:35:16,401
目指すのは メロウなエンディング
Aiming for a mellow ending

406
00:35:19,561 --> 00:35:22,991
それは心臓を 刹那に揺らすもの
It's something that shakes the heart in an instant

407
00:35:23,181 --> 00:35:27,731
追いかけた途端に見失っちゃうの
The moment you chase after it, you lose sight of it

408
00:35:28,201 --> 00:35:32,941
きっと永遠が どっかにあるんだと
Surely eternity is somewhere out there

409
00:35:33,281 --> 00:35:38,411
明後日を 探し回るのも 悪くはないでしょう
Searching around for the day after tomorrow isn't so bad, is it?

410
00:35:39,081 --> 00:35:47,041
お前がどっかに消えた朝より どんな夜の方が まだましさ
Rather than the morning when you disappeared somewhere, a night like this is still better

411
00:35:48,961 --> 00:35:55,321
肺に睡蓮 遠くのサイレン 響き合う境界線
Water lilies in the lungs, a siren in the distance, a boundary line resonating

412
00:35:56,691 --> 00:36:04,901
愛し合う様に喧嘩しようぜ 遺る瀬無し引っさげて
Let's fight like we love each other, carrying our lingering sorrow

413
00:36:06,521 --> 00:36:13,731
肺に睡蓮 遠くのサイレン 響き合う境界線
Water lilies in the lungs, a siren in the distance, a boundary line resonating

414
00:36:15,321 --> 00:36:23,591
愛し合う様に喧嘩しようぜ 遺る瀬無し引っさげて
Let's fight like we love each other, carrying our lingering sorrow

415
00:36:27,261 --> 00:36:35,511
たった一瞬の このきらめきを 食べ尽くそう二人でくたばるまで
Let's devour it together until we drop dead

416
00:36:36,191 --> 00:36:44,681
そして幸運を ぼくに祈りを まだ行こう 誰も追いつけないくらいのスピードで
And wish us good luck... Let's keep going at a speed that nobody can catch up with

417
00:36:45,571 --> 00:36:48,501
それは心臓を 刹那に揺らすもの
It's something that shakes the heart in an instant

418
00:36:48,931 --> 00:36:53,501
追いかけた途端に見失っちゃうの
The moment you chase after it, you lose sight of it

419
00:36:54,201 --> 00:36:58,811
きっと永遠が どっかにあるんだと
Surely eternity is somewhere out there

420
00:36:59,231 --> 00:37:03,911
明後日を探し回るのも 悪くはないでしょう
Searching around for the day after tomorrow isn't so bad, is it?

421
00:37:05,141 --> 00:37:13,931
稲妻の様に生きていたいだけ お前はどうしたい? 返事はいらない
I just want to live like lightning, what do you want to do? I don't need an answer

422
00:37:49,081 --> 00:37:55,211
燃え上がる瓦礫の上に立っている いつからか何故なのか忘れたけど
Standing upon the burning wreckage surrounding me, though I've forgotten why or how long I've been here

423
00:37:55,481 --> 00:37:59,601
息継ぎも出来ない炎の中では
Amidst these flames that choke my breath

424
00:37:59,831 --> 00:38:11,181
探しても見つけても意味がないよ 壊せ超え過去のエクスタシー
No matter what I search for, it's all pointless! So break, and overcome past ecstasy

425
00:38:11,181 --> 00:38:17,891
たとえ最悪でも未来を選べ「行こうぜ」
Even if it's the worst possible outcome, we've got to choose the future! Let's go.

426
00:38:18,181 --> 00:38:24,631
ギリギリまで love forever 悶えるほど歌えば
Reaching the limits of love forever, if we can sing in agony together

427
00:38:24,631 --> 00:38:33,181
魂はウロボロス巻き yeah それでもまだ叫べば
Our souls will coil into an Ouroboros! If we can still manage to scream then

428
00:38:33,181 --> 00:38:45,681
生きることに焦がれれば その先は破滅の純情！
Seething with life beyond abound, what lies beyond is destructive purity!

429
00:38:57,151 --> 00:39:02,411
吹き抜ける狂気を胸に走っている いつまでか何故なのか知らないけど
The madness blowing through my chest, though I don't know for how long or why

430
00:39:02,581 --> 00:39:08,391
瞬きも出来ない速度の中では 嘆いても嘆いても虚しいだけ
Amidst speeds so intense I can't even blink, to cry out or express my woes is just futile

431
00:39:08,661 --> 00:39:14,851
咆哮し弾け他人のエモーション たとえ最低でも自分を選べ
Roar aloud, burst out, our collective emotion! Choose yourself even in the worst reality

432
00:39:16,381 --> 00:39:19,381
「飛ぶぞ」
I'm gonna fly.

433
00:39:20,281 --> 00:39:31,381
スレスレまで love forever 狂えるほど踊れば
To the slimmest margin of love forever, if we can dance to the point of madness

434
00:39:33,281 --> 00:39:41,381
魂は瘤倒と化し yeah それでもまだ動けば
Our souls will reach the critical point! If we can still manage to move then

435
00:39:44,281 --> 00:39:54,181
光る空に届けば その先は破滅の純情！
Reaching that beyond shining star, what lies beyond will be a destructive purity!

436
00:39:53,681 --> 00:40:02,381
純情！ 純情！ 純情！ 純情！ 純情！
Purity! Purity! Purity! Purity! Purity!

437
00:40:03,485 --> 00:40:06,635
燃え上がる 瓦礫の上に 立っている
Standing atop burning rubble,

438
00:40:06,635 --> 00:40:09,385
いつからか 何故なのか 忘れたけど
Though I've forgotten since when or why,

439
00:40:09,385 --> 00:40:12,635
息継ぎも出来ない 炎の中では
Inside the flames where I can't even catch my breath,

440
00:40:12,635 --> 00:40:15,035
探しても 見つけても意味がないよ
Searching or finding it has no meaning.

441
00:40:15,035 --> 00:40:18,485
壊し超えろ 過去のエクスタシー
Break through and surpass past ecstasy,

442
00:40:18,485 --> 00:40:21,135
たとえ最悪でも 未来を選べ
Choose the future, even if it's the worst.

443
00:40:21,135 --> 00:40:22,285
「行・く・よ」
Here we go!

444
00:40:22,285 --> 00:40:25,835
ギリギリまで love forever
Right to the limit, love forever,

445
00:40:25,835 --> 00:40:29,335
悶えるほど歌えば
If you sing until you writhe in agony,

446
00:40:29,335 --> 00:40:31,335
魂は渦を巻き yeah
Your soul swirls, yeah.

447
00:40:31,335 --> 00:40:34,335
それでも まだ叫べば
Even so, if you still cry out,

448
00:40:34,335 --> 00:40:37,935
生きることに焦がれれば
If you burn with a passion to live,

449
00:40:37,935 --> 00:40:43,185
その先は 破滅の純情！
Beyond that lies the pure passion of ruin!

450
00:40:44,185 --> 00:40:47,335
守る覚悟でなら
If you have the resolve to protect,

451
00:40:47,335 --> 00:40:49,785
地獄を進め
Advance through hell.

452
00:40:49,785 --> 00:40:50,935
「好・き・よ」
I love you.

453
00:40:50,935 --> 00:40:54,435
何回目の last game over
How many times is this last game over?

454
00:40:54,435 --> 00:40:57,635
全てをまた無くせば
If we lose everything all over again,

455
00:40:57,635 --> 00:41:02,635
魂は乱麻を断ち yeah
Our souls sever the chaos, yeah.

456
